  "receiver32_startup_test": {
    "state": "unavailable",
    "reason": "Host kernel CONFIG_IA32_EMULATION is not set. Official CPython x86 and own x86 helper both fail before Python startup under Wine. No native DJI code executed."
  },
  "evidence_limits": "1.6.0 adds experimental reception of two lower raw-image topics through a separate own x86 process using user-installed pinned SDK files. No DJI binaries/configuration are redistributed or executed in development. No calibration API is bound, no factory mode or coefficient write is requested. Native transport initialization produces control traffic; full effects and firmware/device compatibility are not validated. Two verified PGM files and a saved ZIP are required for 100 percent; this is not calibration. The x64 frozen app, UI previews, existing SN/HMS/offline readers and Windows job supervisor are tested under Wine with synthetic data. The host lacks IA32 emulation, so x86 startup and real native SDK/image acquisition still require Windows hardware testing. Lower topics do not establish front-right coverage or synchronized calibration samples."
}